# Constitution

Read and obey `CONSTITUTION.md` and `AGENTS.md` at the repo root.

- Edit `src/`, ship `dist/` (`npm run build`). Load unpacked **dist**, never src.
- User-visible copy: `chrome.i18n`, both `src/_locales/en` and `ru` in the same change.
- Side panel `index.ts`: every `let`/`const` at the top. No load-time calls that touch later consts (TDZ).
- Overlay JS/CSS: bump `HUD_REV` in `src/overlay/index.ts`.
- Word lookup uses Google Translate, not the LLM. Screen scan uses a vision model, not gpt-oss text.
- Closed translation plaques stay closed until captions-on-screen (`reopen: true`).
- Commit/push only when the user asks. Commit style `JHE-000N: short lowercase description`. Never force-push `main`.
